{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>הַרְבֶּה אַרְבֶּה</b> — a verb form." "<b>עצבונך</b>: at the time of affliction, when the blood of virginity goes forth." "<b>והרונך</b>: The nun is added, for pregnancy is burdensome upon the woman, and so too childbirth." "<b>תשוקתך</b>: your submissiveness — the sense being that you shall obey all that he commands you, for you are in his domain to do his will."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:01.699315792Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}